{"pageid": 901, "title": "Azure Mask", "revid": 2644, "categories": ["Azure Masks", "Lore", "Masks", "Monster hunters", "Order of St. George"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/13/Azure_Mask.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130215647\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Azure Mask of the North American Houses.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/13/Azure_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241130215647\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Azure Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Azure_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Azure_Mask.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Azure Mask of the North American Houses.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Azure Masks</b> are a branch of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a> who don the color blue and work as spymasters within society. Originally a branch dedicated to the weaponeers of the Order, with the advent of modern technology, they have evolved into being hackers, programmers, planners, and investigators. Unlike other Masks, members of this branch sometimes keep their own surnames and live outside the House.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>Azure Masks are the weaponeers of the Order. In ancient times, they crafted the tools by which hunters would hunt and kill the monsters they faced in the wild. In modern times, where acquiring deadly weapons is not a matter of great difficulty, the Azure Masks have become the spymasters of the Order. It is their duty above all others to prevent the wider world from learning of the existence of monsters and the machinations of the Order of St. George. They infiltrate law enforcement, politics, and news organizations at their highest levels, keeping our great secrets intact.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">The Book of Slaughter</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>In the early days of the Order, the Azure Mask was the color given to the blacksmiths and weapon makers. In modern times, now that weapons are more easy to come by, the color denotes those who work in espionage and various other forms of undercover work. Most Azure Masks find themselves in tech departments, where they suppress news of monster attacks from hitting social media, create stories to cover up incidents, and hack into dangerous systems. Their most important task is to keep monsters' existence hidden from the public. Not all Azures do this, though; many also infiltrate law enforcement, journalism, governments, and the inner circles of the rich in order to get what they need.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>Azures will often live outside of the House,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS28&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS28-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> with some placed on special locations to help cover up training exercises,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC18&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC18-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and others allowed to integrate into society to alleviate suspicion. In the case of the latter, many Azures are allowed to keep their surname and join or start a family outside of the Order, a privilege denied to other branches. As such, lineage recruits are common in this line. Some Azures are so separate from the Order, only doing one or two tasks in their lives, that they stop believing in monsters altogether.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS28&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS28-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>While the number of Azures in a House is usually small, they often work with <a href=\"/wiki/Scarlet_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scarlet Masks\">Scarlet Masks</a>, as the only other branch of non-hunters.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS26&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS26-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Some <a href=\"/wiki/White_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Masks\">White Masks</a> look down on Azures as loners and weaklings.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS28&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS28-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Azure_Masks\">Known Azure Masks</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Buck_Slaughter\" title=\"Buck Slaughter\">Buck Slaughter</a> <small>(leader)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a> †</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Benny Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmVubnlfU2xhdWdodGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Benny Slaughter</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS18&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS18-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Nolan Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTm9sYW5fU2xhdWdodGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Nolan Slaughter</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"99a19b6ae18641ea974d75d7445def0f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Azure_Mask-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:185px; top:42.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Azure_Mask.png\" title=\"Azure Mask.png (443 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/13/Azure_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241130215647\" title=\"Azure Mask.png (443 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Azure Mask of the American Houses.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Azure Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Azure_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\